    "body": "**Lab 2 (OpenCode). Class B** (carries measured numbers). References #820 and #973.\n\nRecords the G v1 outcome in `current-state.md`'s September 28 track list, beside D2's entry: the always-on, address-driven dual-register read **is not yet promoted at this scope** (D12), with the measured numbers and the diagnosed next step.\n\nThe figures are exactly those of the merged G v1 result (`g1-always-on-read-result-2026-09-28.md`, evidence `g1-always-on-read-2026-09-28.json`), whose headline numbers were independently re-read from the sealed roots by a non-author ([#1469 comment](https://github.com/UOR-Foundation/uor-r4/pull/1469#issuecomment-5880232416), verdict \"headline numbers confirmed\", manifest hashes recomputed by the lead).\n\n**Checks:** `python3 scripts/check_claim_wording.py` → pass. Documentation-only change; no code, no new measurement, no experiment.\n\n**Class-B conditions:** sealed roots exist (merged evidence); headline numbers re-read by a non-author (linked above); one non-author confirmation of this one-line entry requested and linked below before merge.\n",
